{
  "rationale": "The plant automata G1 models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating controllable motion pulses from uncontrollable sensor events. The specification automata E1 binds perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative but coverage-biased recovery. E2 prevents repeated recovery or scan actions, ensuring the robot returns to exploration as soon as possible. E3 ensures full_rotate is only used as a last resort after repeated failures to recover.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion/perception and for action commitment.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe, progress-maximizing action selection, conservative recovery, and last-resort scan only after repeated failures."
